Two things,

you should not pass values to arguments within `aes`. For example, you do

aes(x = centroid$`Date of acquisition`...)

but should be

aes(x = `Date of acquisition`...)

The error message says that your variable is (Date of acquisition) is not in the proper Date format. You will have to use `as.Date` to properly convert what you have now to a Date format. If help file for as.Date is not clear enough, please search the internet. This question has been answered many times.

Cheers,
Roman

